# Ocean spray, spawned by the renderer's ocean spray producer (ocean_spray.cs.glsl) over the particle
# GPU spawn path: the producer sets position + velocity, so Rate/Speed/ConeAngle are unused here - only
# the look and the motion after spawn are authored. Rate 0 = no CPU spawns. ONE emitter: the producer
# spawns every request into the first one.
ParticleEffect OceanSpray
	# Atomised mist off the crest: large, soft, slow, drifts and thins out.
	Emitter Mist
		Rate 0
		WaterFloor true
		AboveWater true
		Life 1.5 3.0
		Gravity 1.5
		Drag 1.2
		Turbulence 1.5 0.35 0.3
		Size 0.5 2.0
		SizeVariance 0.4
		ColorStart 0.9, 0.93, 1.0, 0.16
		ColorEnd 0.9, 0.93, 1.0, 0
		Additivity 0
		FadeIn 0.15
		FadeOutStart 0.3
		SoftFade 0.8
		Lit true
		EmissiveFloor 0
		Spin 0.6
